      "t": "h1",
      "text": "About Us"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Home"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "About Us"
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/about-768x672.png",
      "alt": "about",
      "title": null,
      "w": "640",
      "h": "560",
      "srcset": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/about-768x672.png 768w, https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/about-300x263.png 300w, https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/about-600x525.png 600w, https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/about.png 800w"
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Precision, Innovation, Reliability"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Welcome to Rotozest, a leading manufacturer and supplier of high-quality rotary gear pumps. With a strong reputation for excellence, we specialize in providing Cast Iron (CI) and Stainless Steel (SS) rotary gear pumps that cater to a wide range of industries, ensuring efficient and durable pumping solutions. Driven by innovation and expertise, our company is led by visionary owners Hitesh Bhai Patel, and Bharat Patel, whose leadership has positioned Rotozest as a trusted name in the market.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/16.png",
      "alt": "SS Rotary Gear Pump",
      "title": null,
      "w": "1000",
      "h": "1000",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
