    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Our Expertise"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Rotozest has become synonymous with excellence in rotary gear pumps. Our team of skilled engineers and technicians works tirelessly to design and manufacture pumps that meet the demanding requirements of industries such as oil and gas, chemical processing, food and beverage, agriculture, pharmaceuticals, and more.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "With our Cast Iron and Stainless Steel rotary gear pumps, we offer robust and reliable solutions for transferring viscous fluids, oils, chemicals, and other materials. Every pump we produce is engineered for longevity, efficiency, and minimal maintenance.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/vision-r1fvn5l2zdf3jf7m8j1qpmu9ub2y6amims6iae9u8s.png",
      "alt": "vision",
      "title": "vision",
      "w": "150",
      "h": "150",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Vision"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Rotozest, our vision is to become a global leader in the rotary gear pump industry, renowned for our innovative solutions and commitment to quality. We aim to set the standard for excellence by continually improving our products and services, ensuring that our customers experience superior performance and reliability in every application.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/mission-r1fvn5l2zdf3jf7m8j1qpmu9ub2y6amims6iae9u8s.png",
      "alt": "mission",
      "title": "mission",
      "w": "150",
      "h": "150",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "h3",
      "text": "Mission"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Our mission is to deliver high-quality rotary gear pumps that meet the specific needs of our customers across various industries. We are dedicated to providing efficient, durable, and cost-effective solutions that enhance productivity and operational efficiency. Through innovation, continuous improvement, and customer-centric service, we strive to exceed expectations and maintain our leadership in the market.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
